<title>GERMANY: German forwarder Dachser signs Nordic agreements.</title>
<headline>German forwarder Dachser signs Nordic agreements.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>German freight forwarder Dachser GmbH said it has signed new co-operation deals for Scandinavia and Poland.</p>
<p>The new Norway partner is Nor Cargo AS, which has 70 outlets throughout the country, a Dachser statement said.</p>
<p>In Finland, the new Dachser partner is Oy Beweship AB, which also has subsidiaries in Tallinn, St Petersburg and Moscow, the statement added.</p>
<p>The new Poland partner is Lazar/Labatra which has 30 locations throughout the country.</p>
<p>- Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom. Tel +44 171 542 7706; Fax: 5017</p>
<p>- www.racs.com</p>
